                "text": "As a member of the Rural Health Caucus, I had the opportunity to participate in a roundtable to discuss bipartisan policy solutions to improve access to quality, affordable healthcare. \n\nRural communities in Western New York and the Southern Tier face unique challenges when it comes to healthcare access, including provider shortages, geographic barriers, and limited resources. It's crucial that we work together across party lines to address these issues and ensure that all Americans, regardless of where they live, have access to the healthcare they need.",
