                "text": "New CPI numbers are out, showing that inflation is up 20.5% since Joe Biden and Kamala Harris took office and everyday essentials for Americans are even higher:  \n\n\ud83c\udf4e Food at elementary & secondary schools is UP 69.7%. \n\ud83e\udd5a Eggs are UP 69.2%. \n\ud83d\ude97 Motor vehicle insurance is UP 56.5%. \n\u26fd\ufe0f Gasoline (all types) is UP 38.4%. \n\ud83c\udf7c Baby food and formula are UP 31.0%.  \n\n\ud83d\udcc9 Real average weekly earnings are DOWN 3.4%.",
